      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "matrix: width 5, height 5 (25 elements)\nblocks: 4 x 4 threads (16 threads per block)\nblocks needed: 5 / 4 = 1.25 -> round UP -> 2\ngrid: 2 x 2 blocks = 8 x 8 threads = 64\n64 - 25 = 39 threads sitting idle",
